  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "speaker": "Vivian",
      "text": "你说离海近，不会是地图上近吧？",
      "start": 0.18,
      "end": 2.837
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "speaker": "Ryan",
      "text": "不跟你比划，带你走一趟。",
      "start": 2.977,
      "end": 5.086
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "speaker": "Vivian",
      "text": "导游怎么不说话了？",
      "start": 5.366,
      "end": 7.139
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "speaker": "Ryan",
      "text": "让海说，今天不跟它抢麦。",
      "start": 7.279,
      "end": 9.787
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "speaker": "Vivian",
      "text": "这声音，比工作群好听。",
      "start": 10.987,
      "end": 13.807
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "speaker": "Ryan",
      "text": "它不催进度，也不艾特所有人。",
